Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:01.36,Default,,0,0,0,,See, motivation can\Nmake you
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.36,0:00:02.73,Default,,0,0,0,,go there to that\Nplace
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.73,0:00:04.09,Default,,0,0,0,,and okay fine, I\Nwant
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.09,0:00:05.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I want to start\Ndoing
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.46,0:00:06.82,Default,,0,0,0,,this and maine karna\Nhai
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.82,0:00:08.19,Default,,0,0,0,,and I'm going to be
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.19,0:00:09.55,Default,,0,0,0,,able to do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.30,0:00:11.55,Default,,0,0,0,,And then your\Ndiscipline is
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.55,0:00:12.80,Default,,0,0,0,,something which\Nmakes you do
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.80,0:00:14.05,Default,,0,0,0,,it, okay theek hai,\NI
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.05,0:00:15.30,Default,,0,0,0,,have to do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.90,0:00:17.03,Default,,0,0,0,,And obsession is, I\Ncan't
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.03,0:00:18.16,Default,,0,0,0,,do without it, I\Nhave
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.16,0:00:19.29,Default,,0,0,0,,to fucking do it,\Notherwise
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.29,0:00:20.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll die, I have to
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.42,0:00:21.55,Default,,0,0,0,,obsess, obsess,\Nobsess.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.10,0:00:23.21,Default,,0,0,0,,And the ones who\Nmake
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.21,0:00:24.33,Default,,0,0,0,,it are the ones who
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.33,0:00:25.44,Default,,0,0,0,,make that obsession\Npart of
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.44,0:00:26.55,Default,,0,0,0,,their normal life.
